 <section id="approach"><h2>How I approach it</h2><p>{p.focus}</p><p>I want to distinguish what we have observed from what we think explains it. A polished interface or a fluent AI answer can still rest on an assumption that nobody has checked.</p><p>My public projects are ways to explore these questions through working software. They are experiments and learning records; their existence does not establish that a hypothesis is true.</p><a class="arrow-link" href="/work/">See the experiments ↗</a></section>
